{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/107411-looking-for-an-artist-with-a-kind-soul-who-wishes-to-lend-me-a-hand","id":107411,"title":"looking for an artist with a kind soul who wishes to lend me a hand","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-07T06:42:05-07:00","id":107411,"title":"looking for an artist with a kind soul who wishes to lend me a hand","content":"i know theres some artists around the forums, both official that worked on the WoD line and non official that went around and had awesome works. i know theres the 20 years edition of WtA around and i was wondering if someone could draw my nuwisha character &gt;.&lt; i know this might be a bit offtopic but, could someone help me?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T14:26:13-07:00","id":107704,"title":"","content":"I have an artist list for W:tA, Rage CCG (both versions), W:tF, C:tD, Arcadia CCG, VTES, and V:tM over in the &quot;Art&quot; sub-section of the Rage CCG forums (<i>You have to be a forum member there to see it</i>). I should have links if I've been able to find them for certain artists, and I know I haven't done that yet for the VTES and V:tM section yet in the thread.<br /> <br /> Also, there are many volunteer artists on the Rage CCG forums that do art for the Rage fansets. Some of them may be busy with the current set that has yet to be out out, Sea Dogs, though.<br /> <br /> The thread in question: <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/thread/520/rage-ccg-tribal-artist-links\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG, W:tA, W:tF and Tribal War Artist Links</a> (Tribal War = RALV, and I didn't have room to add the other lines.)<br /> <a href=\"http://www.werewolfcardgame.com/rage/artlinks.html\" target=\"_blank\">River Von's section of current Rage Fan Set artist links.</a><br /> <br /> I need to strike out Horley's name in the RALV section since I got confirmation from his booth at Monsterpalooza that the name is miscredited to Horley over someone that used to work in his studios at the time. They gave me a first name of the artist who did those two cards, but no last name. I have a hunch based on the art style (&quot;Paolo Parente&quot;), but I don't have a facebook account to get in direct contact with this artist to get an official word on it.<br /> <br /> <u>Do you want me to post a list without links here then?</u><br /> <br /> Another site to look up for artist credits is <a href=\"http://rpggeek.com/\" target=\"_blank\">RPG Geek.com</a>.<br /> <br /> If you are looking for something more cartoony for a Nuwisha, I know that <a href=\"http://clone-artist.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Clone artist</a> takes commissions.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-10T17:39:26-07:00","id":110433,"title":"","content":"Do you know what you're looking to pay, and for what sort of finished piece? (sketch, roughed, finished pencils, lineart, b/w/grayscale, full-color, bust, full-body, 5-forms, etc.)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/av